# Project Always Rules

## Never commit
- `.env` — secrets
- `agent-context/` (gitignored)

## Branch naming
`feat/[ticket-id]` · `fix/[ticket-id]` · `chore/[description]`

## API
Respect customer/provider/admin route split. Validate inputs. Use errorHandler.

## Docs
Update BACKEND_API.md / Postman when adding endpoints.

## PR size
Prefer PRs under ~400 lines changed.
